om2 diag bce
note bce fixture sum (body after a lead line): global array, two for loops with K = len 64. Every
note get a i / put a i check is redundant (rule forbnd): erased under om2 bce, kept under om2.
note Exit: sum of 3i for i < 64 = 6048, mod 251 = 24.
global a ulong 64
global b ulong 64
fn main to int
for i ulong 64
put a i mul i 3
put b i 200
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 64
s = add s get a i
end
ret int rem s 251
end
